  C_9 &= 682 \\
  C_{10} &= 409 \\
  C_{11} &= 342 \\
  C_{12} &= 903 \\
  C_{13} &= 680 \\
  C_{14} &= 886 \\
  \end{align*}
  \]

- For each vessel type $j \in P$, let $v_j$ be its value and $w_j$ its weight (size):

  \[
  \begin{align*}
  &\text{Speedboat:} \quad v = 29664, \quad w = 18 \\
